# LLM instruction files are consumed as raw text by a model, not rendered.
# Prettier's markdown normalization (code-span space stripping, emphasis
# delimiters, table padding) changes bytes the instructions name literally —
# e.g. `` ` — ` `` in AGENTS.md rule 6 becomes `` `—` `` — and buries small
# content edits under a hundred lines of reformatting.
personal/pi/**/*.md
